# The trust package's manifest (format: packages/README.md).
package trust
version 0.1.0
summary records and checks of PatLang package trust: views, genesis, transitions, releases, withdrawals, quorum certificates, the signature check in PatLang (Ed25519, from the curve25519 package), the per-user trust store and project lock file, and publishing: keys, genesis, releases proposed, signed, certified and withdrawn, and a package verified against the store's pin and epoch
entry trust.patlang
include trust.patlang
include records.patlang
include checks.patlang
include verify.patlang
include ed25519.patlang
include store.patlang
include publish.patlang
depends sha256 >= 0.1.0, < 0.2.0
depends curve25519 >= 0.1.0, < 0.2.0
